# HdrHistogram_c (vendored)

This directory contains a vendored copy of
[HdrHistogram_c](https://github.com/HdrHistogram/HdrHistogram_c), the C port of
Gil Tene's [HdrHistogram](https://github.com/HdrHistogram/HdrHistogram).

The code is released to the public domain (CC0).  Primary author is Michael
Barker; other contributors include Marco Ippolito, Philip Orwig and Filipe
Oliveira, as credited in the per-file headers:

    Written by Michael Barker and released to the public domain,
    as explained at http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/

See the per-file headers under `include/` and `src/` for the full notices.
